cff-version: 1.2.0
title: prototype-space
message: >-
  If you use this collection in your work, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  An open collection of resources for turning an idea into a working prototype:
  tools and buildable open-source projects, datasets, hardware and workspace
  access around Bonn and North Rhine-Westphalia, funding contacts, product
  compliance references, and routes to publishing finished work.
authors:
  - name: "Robonn — Robotics Club, University of Bonn"
repository-code: "https://github.com/robonn-club/prototype-space"
url: "https://robonn-club.github.io/prototype-space/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - robotics
  - prototyping
  - open hardware
  - open data
  - agricultural robotics
